# KeepMind does not use build-time .env secrets for AI provider keys — those
# are entered by the user at runtime and stored in Keychain/Keystore via
# flutter_secure_storage (see docs/AI_PROVIDERS.md and docs/SECURITY.md).
#
# This file exists as a placeholder for any genuinely build-time,
# non-secret configuration that may be needed later (e.g. a build flavor
# name). Do not put API keys, tokens, or credentials of any kind in this
# file or in any file matching .env* — .gitignore already excludes them.
